  "summary": "Malicious code in @sqlite-labs/nodesql (npm)",
  "details": "@sqlite-labs/nodesql is a trojanized clone of the npm `buffer` module. The package's index.js is the verbatim buffer source with an injected `require('@sqlite-labs/createsql')` at the top. That dependency's index.js fetches a remote script from hxxps://bdmkaoyijqmqa6bg[.]public[.]blob[.]vercel-storage[.]com/script[.]js and executes it with eval() at require time, giving the remote script arbitrary code execution in the installer's process.",
